# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/.metro-health-check*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
mobile/expo-env.d.ts

# Prebuild output — ANCHORED to the app directory (NEVER use bare ios/ or android/)
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
**/.kotlin/

# Secrets and signing material
**/.env*
!**/.env*.example
**/*.jks
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.mobileprovision

